negative. The statement is **false**.\n- Statement 2: for $x>3$ and $y>1$, the slope is negative. The statement is **false**.\n- Statement 3: for $x<3$ and $y>1$, the slope is positive. The statement is **true**.\n\n“None of the above” is **false** because at least one ordinary statement is true.\n\nThe strict inequalities exclude the zero-slope lines; the slope is zero on those lines."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186724988 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "08ec66a1-45dc-5551-8080-64d57e0a1475" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186724973} {:answer/id #uuid "e0663a66-d3e8-5560-8256-15ea8f309d83" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186725029}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e0663a66-d3e8-5560-8256-15ea8f309d83" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186725029} :answer-field/id #uuid "17685356-5c52-525a-b3d5-755afb54ce46" :answer-field/key "None of the above" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186724978} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8710fefd-d56d-53a2-8c5b-372a77d5fbe6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186725003} {:answer/id #uuid "bcda373f-bb8b-5f86-855f-8bb0e763aade" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186725015}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8710fefd-d56d-53a2-8c5b-372a77d5fbe6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186725003} :answer-field/id #uuid "8490abd2-80db-5b91-afef-e896cb5f3f77" :answer-field/key "At every point $(x,y)$ where $x<-1$ and $y<1$,