-$ | $+$ | $-$ |\n| $x>-3$, $y>-3$ | $+$ | $+$ | $+$ |\n| $x<-3$, $y<-3$ | $-$ | $-$ | $+$ |\n| $x>-3$, $y<-3$ | $+$ | $-$ | $-$ |\n\n![Signs of the slope in all four open regions.](images/92/92ae6632134f213288777776cf896d856f859417c253a39e3d2accd92a95d692.png)\n\n- Statement 1: for $x>-3$ and $y<-3$, the slope is negative. The statement is **true**.\n- Statement 2: for $x>-3$ and $y>-3$, the slope is positive. The statement is **true**.\n- Statement 3: for $x<-3$ and $y<-3$, the slope is positive. The statement is **true**.\n\n“None of the above” is **false** because at least one ordinary statement is true.\n\nThe strict inequalities exclude the zero-slope lines; the slope is zero on those lines."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186725090 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8ebf53ba-1ec5-575d-a8fc-eb93c2aa983d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186725070} {:answer/id #uuid "cb0e3f0b-b8cc-579e-9bc9-a362c1d35f64" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186725077}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8ebf53ba-1ec5-575d-a8fc-eb93c2aa983d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186725070} :answer-field/id #uuid "08d64825-05af-55f7-bdc0-3e8f27491fcf" :answer-field/key "At every point $(x,y)$ where $x>-1$ and $y<2$, the slope of the slope field is positive." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186725040} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "567e5e17-5bea-5ffc-ab5a-d26c67a1b092" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186725056} {:answer/id #uuid "582ad6ac-5221-5c66-8e1a-f02ea5ae9025" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text